{"id":"revelation","links":[{"id":"q100","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":10,"v":6},"b":{"book":"exodus","c":20,"v":11},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Revelation says He “created heaven and everything in it”; Exodus says the LORD made “the heavens and the earth and the sea.”"},{"id":"q101","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":14,"v":7},"b":{"book":"exodus","c":20,"v":11},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Revelation repeats “made the heavens and the earth and the sea”; Exodus says the LORD made them in six days."},{"id":"q286","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":2,"v":26},"b":{"book":"psalms","c":2,"v":8},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Revelation says “I will give authority over the nations”; Psalms says “I will make the nations Your inheritance.”"},{"id":"q287","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":2,"v":27},"b":{"book":"psalms","c":2,"v":9},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Revelation repeats “an iron scepter” and “shatter them like pottery”; Psalms says, “You will break them with an iron scepter.”"},{"id":"q444","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":10,"v":6},"b":{"book":"psalms","c":146,"v":6},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Revelation says He “created heaven and everything in it”, and the earth and the sea; Psalms calls God “the Maker of heaven and earth”."},{"id":"q445","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":14,"v":7},"b":{"book":"psalms","c":146,"v":6},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Revelation names “the One who made the heavens and the earth and the sea”; Psalms calls God “the Maker of heaven and earth”."},{"id":"q450","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":3,"v":19},"b":{"book":"proverbs","c":3,"v":12},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Revelation has “Those I love I rebuke and discipline”; Proverbs says “the LORD disciplines the one He loves”."},{"id":"q474","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":4,"v":8},"b":{"book":"isaiah","c":6,"v":3},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Revelation repeats the cry “Holy, Holy, Holy” from Isaiah, but names “the Lord God Almighty” where Isaiah names “the LORD of Hosts”."},{"id":"q506","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":3,"v":7},"b":{"book":"isaiah","c":22,"v":22},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Revelation repeats Isaiah: “What He opens no one can shut”, and speaks of “the key of David”."},{"id":"q649","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":9,"v":20},"b":{"book":"daniel","c":5,"v":23},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Revelation repeats Daniel’s description of idols of metal, wood and stone “which cannot see or hear or” walk or understand."},{"id":"q655","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":1,"v":7},"b":{"book":"daniel","c":7,"v":13},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Revelation repeats Daniel’s words “coming with the clouds,” and adds that every eye will see Him."},{"id":"q656","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":13,"v":7},"b":{"book":"daniel","c":7,"v":21},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Revelation says the beast could “wage war against the saints”; Daniel says a horn was “waging war against the saints and prevailing against them.”"},{"id":"q670","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":6,"v":16},"b":{"book":"hosea","c":10,"v":8},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Revelation repeats Hosea’s cry “Fall on us,” said “to the mountains,” and adds “hide us” where Hosea has “Cover us!”"},{"id":"q708","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":1,"v":7},"b":{"book":"zechariah","c":12,"v":10},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"Revelation says “those who pierced Him” and tribes “will mourn”; Zechariah says “the One they have pierced” and “will mourn for Him.”"},{"id":"q778","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":1,"v":17},"b":{"book":"isaiah","c":41,"v":4},"upstream":["kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Revelation has “I am the First and the Last”; Isaiah has the LORD say “the first and the last.”"},{"id":"q779","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":1,"v":17},"b":{"book":"isaiah","c":44,"v":6},"upstream":["kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Revelation has “I am the First and the Last”; Isaiah has the LORD say “I am the first and I am the last.”"},{"id":"q780","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":2,"v":23},"b":{"book":"jeremiah","c":17,"v":10},"upstream":["kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Revelation says “I am the One who searches minds and hearts”; Jeremiah says “I, the LORD, search the heart; I examine the mind.”"},{"id":"q781","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":7,"v":16},"b":{"book":"isaiah","c":49,"v":10},"upstream":["kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Revelation repeats Isaiah’s promise that people will not hunger or thirst, and that no “scorching heat” or sun will beat down on them."},{"id":"q782","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"revelation","c":21,"v":23},"b":{"book":"isaiah","c":60,"v":20},"upstream":["kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"Revelation says the city needs no “sun or moon” because God’s glory lights it; Isaiah says “the LORD will be your everlasting light.”"},{"id":"h988","type":"echo","source":"Berean Standard Bibl